            <p class="hero-subtitle text-start ms-0 mb-3 text-muted" style="max-width: 550px; font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.5vw, 1.1rem);">Modern courses, proven results — join thousands who transformed their future with our expert guidance.</p>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              <a href="/listings/index2" class="btn-premium">Explore Courses <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></a>
              <a href="#contact" class="btn-outline-premium">Contact Us</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel-item" style="height: 100vh;">
