            <p class="hero-subtitle text-start ms-0 mb-3 text-muted" style="max-width: 550px; font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.5vw, 1.1rem);">Dedicated mentors, small batches, and measurable progress tailored to your unique learning style.</p>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              <a href="/mentor" class="btn-premium">Find a Mentor <i class="ri-user-heart-line"></i></a>
              <a href="/listings/index2" class="btn-outline-premium">Meet Toppers</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel-item" style="height: 100vh;">
        <div class="hero-overlay" style="position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4)); z-index: 1;"></div>
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529070538774-1843cb3265df?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1950&q=80" class="d-block w-100 h-100" style="object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy" alt="Outcomes">
        <div class="carousel-caption d-flex flex-column justify-content-center text-start h-100" style="z-index: 2; left: 10%; right: 10%; bottom: 0;">
          <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="badge-premium mb-2" style="width: fit-content;"> Real Success Stories</div>
